<div class="chilo"><section class="process" id="method"><div class="ch-container"><div class="process-heading"><div><div class="mono eyebrow">THE CHILO METHOD</div><h2 class="section-heading" style="margin-top:21px">Substance<br><i>over noise.</i></h2></div><p>Each professional conversation should start with documented information, not assumptions. We are building a system that puts provenance, independent laboratory results, and honest stock status at the centre.</p></div><div class="process-grid"><article class="process-card"><span class="count">01</span><h3>Source with intention.</h3><p>Supplier and farm details are reviewed before inclusion in verified buyer material.</p></article><article class="process-card"><span class="count">02</span><h3>Verify every batch.</h3><p>COA, sample identity, batch data and specialist review are recorded when supplied and verified.</p></article><article class="process-card"><span class="count">03</span><h3>Communicate clearly.</h3><p>Current availability and documents remain unconfirmed until the responsible team validates them.</p></article></div></div></section></div>
